  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mental Health Awareness Initiative - YLE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Leaders Exchange project will be attached to the pilot project between FUN and CYC. The pilot project is an advocacy project highlights and raises awareness on mental health struggles and challenges in children and youths in Zambia. Through this Youth Leaders Exchange project, we intend to motivate youth leaders from FUN and CYF to commit to the project for a minimum period of six months to help create a strong and close collaboration between the two organisations, contribute to the evaluation and development of the project, and help anchor the experiences and learnings from the project into their respective organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
